`src/lib/soundtrack/**`, `src/app/api/soundtrack/**`, `src/components/vysion-music/**` (transport/playback/create/sync), `soundtrack-public-mutations.ts`, playback contract tests.

UI-only taken: diff mag **geen** create/sync/playback/auth/transport raken tenzij expliciet vrijgegeven.
